1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,633
Have you ever heard of a show called Nanny 911?

2
00:00:03,882 --> 00:00:06,326
They're every parent's worst nightmare.

3
00:00:06,509 --> 00:00:08,438
Shut up! I hate you! I hate you!

4
00:00:08,479 --> 00:00:10,757
Kids completely out of control.

5
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,181
Look, I'm skating, I'm skating!

6
00:00:13,459 --> 00:00:16,195
It's time to call Nanny 911.

7
00:00:18,160 --> 00:00:22,549
We've gathered a team of world-class nannies to help families in crisis.

8
00:00:24,361 --> 00:00:27,333
Parents of America, help is on the way!

9
00:00:27,972 --> 00:00:31,482
Tonight... - Mom, I need another energy drink!

10
00:00:31,496 --> 00:00:34,816
This eight year old son of a single parent just won't behave.

11
00:00:34,904 --> 00:00:37,432
Wir müssen die Juden ausrotten!

12
00:00:37,474 --> 00:00:41,043
And Nanny Stella is selected to set him straight.

13
00:00:41,600 --> 00:00:47,364
It's time for Nanny Stella to show Eric Cartman his ways are not going to be tolerated anymore!

14
00:00:52,597 --> 00:00:55,388
Mom, are you deaf?! Somebody's at the door!

15
00:00:55,680 --> 00:00:58,319
Yes. I think it's the nanny, boopsiekins.

16
00:00:58,583 --> 00:01:00,710
Killer. I'm gonna be on TV now.

17
00:01:01,363 --> 00:01:03,349
Hello. I'm Nanny Stella.

18
00:01:03,433 --> 00:01:05,733
Oh, thank you so much for coming. Please come in.

19
00:01:07,278 --> 00:01:09,278
And you must be Eric.

20
00:01:09,364 --> 00:01:12,042
Mom, I want a Twinkie. - All, all right dear.

21
00:01:12,139 --> 00:01:16,450
Hold on, Mrs. Cartman. There are going to be some rule changes around here, Eric.

22
00:01:16,506 --> 00:01:19,950
First of all, no video games until chores are done.

23
00:01:20,895 --> 00:01:22,506
Hah! Hahahaha!

24
00:01:22,673 --> 00:01:26,145
I'm serious. Let's put down the video game and go to the kitchen.

25
00:01:26,172 --> 00:01:28,062
No thanks, I'd rather naught.

26
00:01:28,075 --> 00:01:30,341
Right. Then I'm going to have to take it.

27
00:01:31,038 --> 00:01:33,205
The hell do you think you're doing? - Come on.

28
00:01:34,538 --> 00:01:38,139
This video game is going right here on the counter until we've done some chores.

29
00:01:38,347 --> 00:01:41,334
Now, first thing we're going to do is make your bed.

30
00:01:42,528 --> 00:01:44,875
Eric, no! This is not acceptable!

31
00:01:45,111 --> 00:01:47,275
Stop trying to bogart my X-Box, you fat bitch!

32
00:01:47,519 --> 00:01:50,491
All right, that's it! You're going to time-out!

33
00:01:50,922 --> 00:01:51,640
Time out?

34
00:01:51,783 --> 00:01:56,269
Whenever you are naughty, Eric, you are going to sit on this stool for five minutes.

35
00:01:57,564 --> 00:01:59,967
And what exactly keeps me on the stool?

36
00:02:00,287 --> 00:02:03,842
It's the time-out stool. You can't get down until the time is up.

37
00:02:06,198 --> 00:02:08,156
Whoa, how did I do that?

38
00:02:10,578 --> 00:02:12,759
Eric, you have to stay in time-out!

39
00:02:13,009 --> 00:02:14,342
Ummm, no?

40
00:02:14,495 --> 00:02:16,467
Come on, you don't have a choice.

41
00:02:16,939 --> 00:02:18,918
All right, seriously, you're starting to piss me off now.

42
00:02:18,946 --> 00:02:22,112
Eric, you need to listen to me. This is very important.

43
00:02:22,390 --> 00:02:26,489
I am getting down to eye level with Eric so that I can talk to him on his level.

44
00:02:26,586 --> 00:02:30,503
Eric, you need to understand why you are being punished. All right?

45
00:02:30,656 --> 00:02:32,461
I'm just gonna get down as soon as you move.

46
00:02:32,503 --> 00:02:35,544
Well then, I'll just have to stand right here!

47
00:02:37,322 --> 00:02:37,989
Oh!

48
00:02:38,836 --> 00:02:40,769
He spit in my mouth!

49
00:02:40,866 --> 00:02:43,366
Yeah, it's best to avoid his level.

50
00:02:43,644 --> 00:02:48,232
All right! I've dealt with this before! We just need to use psychology on him!

51
00:02:48,524 --> 00:02:53,079
Don't stop believing. Hold on to that feeling.

52
00:02:53,107 --> 00:02:56,176
Eric, can I just talk to you for a quick second?

53
00:02:57,180 --> 00:03:00,444
Why are you so angry? - Because you took my X-Box.

54
00:03:00,513 --> 00:03:02,721
Is this about more than your video game?

55
00:03:02,777 --> 00:03:06,669
Are you feeling angry at me because you think I'm here to change your life?

56
00:03:07,489 --> 00:03:08,975
Well, yeah.

57
00:03:09,058 --> 00:03:13,128
And you're feeling like I have no right to come in and tell you how to live.

58
00:03:13,447 --> 00:03:15,120
Yeah. I guess so.

59
00:03:15,328 --> 00:03:19,273
See this? You have to take the time to talk to your children about their feelings.

60
00:03:19,592 --> 00:03:21,494
What else are you feeling, Eric?

61
00:03:21,912 --> 00:03:26,295
Well, I'm feeling confused, because I don't understand why you became a nanny.

62
00:03:26,865 --> 00:03:30,837
Me? Well, it's because I love children, like you.

63
00:03:31,129 --> 00:03:35,295
Right, but... if you love children so much, how come you're not a mommy?

64
00:03:35,601 --> 00:03:38,944
Oh, I just never had kids. - Why not?

65
00:03:39,456 --> 00:03:41,932
It... just... didn't happen.

66
00:03:42,539 --> 00:03:44,414
You're sterile, is that it?

67
00:03:44,956 --> 00:03:47,161
No, that's too convenient of an excuse.

68
00:03:47,188 --> 00:03:50,689
The truth is, nobody ever wanted to have babies with you. Isn't that it?

69
00:03:50,953 --> 00:03:53,079
Always  the mom's maid and never the mom?

70
00:03:53,121 --> 00:03:56,079
Must be hard on you, knowing that the years are ticking away.

71
00:03:56,111 --> 00:03:59,691
Your friends all getting married and all the while your uterus is slowly shriveling away.

72
00:03:59,826 --> 00:04:02,508
Drying up, becoming totally worthless.

73
00:04:02,744 --> 00:04:07,914
Why you, you... you little bastard! How dare you?!

74
00:04:08,039 --> 00:04:10,875
Eric, naughty. - What kind of monster would-

75
00:04:10,876 --> 00:04:13,747
Yes,  let the anger come! Strike me down while you can!

76
00:04:13,806 --> 00:04:16,090
But it won't make your dried-up ovaries any more fertile!

77
00:04:16,125 --> 00:04:18,209
That's it! I'm not doing this!

78
00:04:18,236 --> 00:04:19,983
Oh, but we really need some help.

79
00:04:20,003 --> 00:04:23,565
Find yourself another nanny... televison show!

80
00:04:24,684 --> 00:04:27,128
Coming up next, it's Super Nanny!

81
00:04:27,395 --> 00:04:30,173
Where other nannies fail, Nanny Jo comes through.

82
00:04:40,923 --> 00:04:41,938
This child's behavior is totally unacceptable!

